choose size | S, M, L
toggle dark | Dark mode
param press unit=x | Press depth | 0.94 0.85 1 0.01
ask note | Note
preset a | Not an option | size=XL
preset b | Not on or off | dark=yes
preset c | Out of range | press=1.5
preset d | Off the grid | press=0.945
preset e | Not a number | press=fast
preset f | All fine | size=M; dark=on; press=0.9; note=anything
export json
